# Project Vision

This website is not intended to function as a conventional personal portfolio.

Instead, it serves as a digital headquarters that represents my professional identity as an independent researcher, software engineer, and builder.

The platform combines institutional-quality presentation with modern web technology, allowing visitors to understand not only what I have built, but also how I think.

Every page should communicate clarity, rigor, and long-term thinking.

