## Philosophy

The website should feel less like browsing a portfolio and more like visiting a modern research institution.

Every page should emphasize clarity over decoration, structure over noise, and substance over marketing.

The interface exists to support the content—not compete with it.

# Design Principles

- Institutional over Personal
- Editorial over Decorative
- Minimal over Complex
- Timeless over Trendy
- Research before Marketing
- Clarity before Animation
- Substance before Visual Effects
- Accessibility before Novelty